# Copy to .env (git-ignored) for local runs. NEVER commit real keys.
# The web demo needs none of this: verification runs in the browser, and the Cloudflare Worker uses free Workers AI (no key).
# Only the LOCAL app's "Ask & Verify" needs a key from any OpenAI-compatible provider:
OPENAI_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
# Optional hosted CAMeLBERT-MSA span detector for the local app
# ICV_HF_MODEL=
# HF_TOKEN=
